WEBVTT

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.220
Romeo... Nagisa Misumi.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.560
Juliet... Honoka Yukishiro.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.360
Romeo... Nagisa Misumi.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.540
Juliet... Honoka Yukishiro.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.960
Romeo... Nagisa Misumi.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.880
Stone Keeper finally managed to escape,

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.490
and right before he could come back to us,

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.330
he was caught by the Dark 
Warriors, and taken back.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.700
We have to do something, 
and rescue Stone Keeper.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.280
That's all the votes.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:42.680
From our class, Nagisa 
Misumi will be Romeo...

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:45.270
And Juliet will be Honoka Yukishiro.

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:47.070
What?

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.000
Are you serious?

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:54.330
And Shiho Kubota will be the director.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:55.720
Okay... okay... okay...

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.060
I'm counting on all of you!

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:02.900
In charge of costumes will 
be me, Natsuko Hoshino...

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.410
And Kyoko Mori.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:08.580
Nagisa... Let's work together,

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:12.760
and create the world's 
greatest "Romeo and Juliet."

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:14.980
Give me a break!

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:17.960
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:20.760
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:23.590
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:27.870
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:30.840
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.710
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:35.610
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:39.510
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:41.110
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:46.920
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:49.020
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:52.790
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:56.790
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:59.360
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:02.530
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:05.400
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:11.680
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:12.580
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:15.280
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:18.080
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:20.990
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:22.550
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:25.620
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:31.620
Don't move...

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:33.460
It's done!

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:36.100
What is this?

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:38.290
It's perfect! Just perfect!

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:39.530
It's exactly like I imagined.

00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:45.400
Shiho! How about this for Juliet?

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.080
Beautiful! Just beautiful!

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.520
Exactly what I imagined.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.970
You look really good in that!

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:55.430
Kyoko and Natsuko...

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.020
You two are good at making 
costumes, aren't you?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.360
That's supposed to be...

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:07.890
Please! Forget about that.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:11.000
Are you making any progress?

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:14.430
I made a few changes in the script...

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:15.750
Will you take a look at it?

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.940
I thought I'd take this 
opportunity to try a new

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:21.180
"Romeo and Juliet" that only we can do.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.750
Just go for it...

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.240
You're the director.

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:25.930
Thank you!

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:31.560
Shall we start rehearsals?

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:39.560
"FIRST STAGE PERFORMANCE!! 
DON'T LOSE, ROMEO AND JULIET"

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:50.630
What's going on, Belzay?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:54.650
Belzay!

00:03:58.990 --> 00:04:00.160
I'd better brush my teeth, too.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:02.560
Was it carelessness or...?

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.600
Answer me, Belzay!

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:10.160
That was a pretty bold move.

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:16.830
And you two...!

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:18.530
I'm sorry zakenna!

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:21.590
It's his fault! He's always 
screwing up. He's an idiot!

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:25.010
Zakenna! Don't blame it all on me zakenna!

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:27.010
Stop blaming each other!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:32.150
Please don't tell Jyaku-King 
about this mistake...

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:35.880
We have to report any mistakes to Jyaku-King.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:39.530
No, please! You can't zakenna...!

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:41.600
We're begging you zakenna!

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:44.180
I'll start with my decision...

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:48.960
I won't report what happened 
this time to Jyaku-King.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.460
Really zakenna?

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:53.740
Thank you zakenna!

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:55.930
Do you have any complaints...?

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:57.210
No, but...

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:59.810
We only have one mission...

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:01.400
Isn't that right, Regine?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.380
From now on, I'll brush 
my teeth after every meal.

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:08.520
However, if this ever happens again...

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:10.330
It'll never happen again!

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.650
Zakenna!

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:14.070
How's this zakenna?

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:20.980
We'll never let him escape again zakenna!

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:22.330
Serves you right!

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:24.690
All right.

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:26.770
I'll go.

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:34.960
Juliet... I... uh... You...

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:37.710
What was my line?

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:40.260
Cut! Cut! Cut!

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:41.980
Nagisa... you're no good at all.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.210
It's not just that you 
don't know your lines...

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:45.330
There's no emotion in it at all!

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:48.580
Will you stop trying to fly 
by the seat of your pants?

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:51.060
It's not that I...

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.790
You have to become Romeo, heart and soul.

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:56.760
I know you can do it, Nagisa.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.340
Shiho's great at giving stage directions...

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:01.490
She wants to be a movie director...

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:03.240
Her dream is to work in Hollywood.

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:05.250
Hollywood...?

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:08.540
The theme of this play is action!

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.460
A fighting Romeo and Juliet.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.030
It sounds like it's going to turn 
into something awesome, doesn't it?

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.410
I wonder if we can keep up.

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:19.830
That's why I want you to portray a more 
positive and aggressive Romeo, Nagisa...

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:20.380
Understand?

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.090
I'll do my best.

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:26.290
We'll change the schedule for today, 
and practice our fighting scene.

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.290
Nagisa! Memorize your lines by tomorrow.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.490
I will.

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:35.490
How nice... Doing a play by 
the genius Shakespeare...

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:37.950
I would have liked to do it if I could...

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:39.840
Then take my place.

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:42.490
There's a big difference between 
watching a play and being in it.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:46.780
Especially for Nagisa, who's good at doing 
things intuitively and getting herself psyched up,

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:48.900
but not too good when she 
has to follow a script...

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:49.920
Right, Nagisa?

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.890
I can't even memorize my lines.

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:55.870
Don't let it bother you.

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:59.160
I hate to think of what's 
going to happen tomorrow.

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:04.840
Juliet... I will do anything for you.

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:08.320
Oh, Romeo... Why must you be Romeo?

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.970
What are you doing there?

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:11.080
Brother?

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:12.880
You're a Montague.

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.580
What have you done to my sister?

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:17.060
Run, Romeo! Hurry!

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:19.060
Go where the blade won't reach you.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.020
I won't run away.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.000
Stop babbling! You're a thief 
who deceived the public.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:30.650
Uh... T... tell me, Juliet!

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:33.440
Am I supposed to give 
you up, and run away...?

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:36.340
Cut! Cut! Cut!

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:37.750
That's no good at all!

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:41.140
It has no power! No impact! 
It's not at all convincing.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.590
Didn't I tell you the theme 
of this play in action?

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:46.270
It's less than a week before 
the Verone Festival.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:48.390
I'm counting on all of you!

00:07:48.390 --> 00:07:49.710
Let's do it once more!

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:58.140
Am I supposed to give you up, and run away?

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:01.020
I can't do that.

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:04.330
It sounds strange.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.590
You don't have to tell me... I know that!

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.430
Have you memorized your lines mepo?

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:12.070
I don't have confidence.

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:20.600
I know! If I forget my lines, 
will you whisper it to me?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:21.740
Are you going to cheat popo?

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:25.730
If I stop in the middle of the play, 
it'll cause problems for everyone else.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.230
Okay? Please!

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:31.530
What's "Romeo and Juliet" about mepo?

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:37.320
"Romeo and Juliet" is a love 
story about a man and a woman

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:42.290
who are caught in the middle of two feuding 
families, that ends in tragedy mipo.

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:45.700
But that will never happen to us mepo.

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:48.880
But if Nagisa and Honoka 
fight with each other,

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.190
we won't be able to see each other mipo.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:55.530
Don't worry... We won't 
fight... Will we, Nagisa?

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:57.900
Are you okay, Nagisa?

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:00.600
I have insurance.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.080
Insurance?

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:07.350
Pollun and I memorized all 
of Nagisa's lines mepo.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.760
Can Pollun read?

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:12.190
He's just copying Nagisa, and playing mepo.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.750
Are you just about ready?

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.290
Nagisa... Your mother and 
little brother are here.

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:21.770
I told them not to come.

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:24.970
Honoka... Fujimura-san is 
here to see the play, too.

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:29.640
We don't have enough armor costumes...

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:31.110
They're not mixed in with yours, are they?

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:33.830
I don't think they're here.

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:35.340
That's strange.

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:39.230
Are you okay, Nagisa?

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:40.330
Nagisa!

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:43.490
I'm... not okay!

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.740
I can't wait to see it.

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:51.720
The theme is action...

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:53.600
I wonder how it will turn out.

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:56.460
I don't know... I've left 
it all to the students.

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.720
I'm a tough critic...

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:03.370
After all, I've seen a live stage 
performance when I went on a study tour.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:08.210
I'm not bragging.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:09.440
You're bragging.

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:15.240
Principal! We saw it together, didn't we?

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.730
I had an upset stomach, and 
was sleeping in the hotel.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:24.050
The second-year Sakura class will 
now perform "Romeo and Juliet."

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:34.840
Nagisa... Are you okay popo?

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:37.490
No! I'm not! What was my first line?

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:39.010
Pull yourself together mepo!

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:40.440
You're on mepo!

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:41.310
You're kidding!

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:43.150
Hurry, and go mepo!

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:46.300
Nagisa!

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:52.120
I've already screwed up from the start.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:56.130
My arms and legs don't seem to belong to me.

00:10:56.870 --> 00:10:58.190
Fuji-P is watching!

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:04.380
Hang in there, Sis!!

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.380
Pull yourself together!

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:07.390
Are you all right?

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:10.190
Huh? Hello.

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:12.720
Nagisa!

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.740
What's your name?

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:16.700
Juliet.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:17.730
What's yours?

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:21.000
I'm Romeo. Please dance with me.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.280
I'll be happy to.

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:29.060
Will Nagisa be okay?

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:31.810
Hey, Sis! Is your butt okay?

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:36.280
Ryota! Please don't talk to me now!

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:39.470
What is she doing? It's all falling apart!

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:43.080
Didn't they rehearse enough? 
It's hardly worth watching.

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:44.580
You don't have to go that far!

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:47.710
After all, I've seen a 
live stage performance...

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.940
I was sleeping in the hotel.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.370
Hang in there Misumi-san.

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:16.360
Oh, Romeo... Why must you be Romeo?

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:17.790
What are you doing there?

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.250
Brother...!

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:21.230
You're a Montague...

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.460
What have you done to my little sister?

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:25.930
Run away, Romeo!

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:29.260
Hurry! Run to where that 
blade won't reach you!

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:35.020
Uh... What...?

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.590
I forgot my line!

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:40.050
What comes next?

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:42.790
Hurry, Pollun!

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:44.550
They're coming popo!

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.710
They're coming popo!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.110
Scratch that popo!

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:53.330
No, Nagisa! No popo!

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:58.020
No, Nagisa! No...

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:03.720
Nagisa! It's... "I won't run away."

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:05.690
What is this?

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:08.720
Aren't there more of you now?

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:10.200
Go!

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:13.000
Zakenna!

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:20.110
Zakenna!

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:24.220
This is...!

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:27.530
You're strong! Who's in there?

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:31.730
Nagi... I mean Romeo! No! It's not...

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:34.230
What? Did I make a mistake again?

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:39.300
Romeo! Those soldiers are...

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:40.600
Zakenna!

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:46.030
It can't be! Is that what this is, Juliet?

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:51.550
Sis...?

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:53.870
Nagisa!

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:55.390
You're both doing great!

00:13:57.840 --> 00:13:59.850
What's going on? I can't keep up.

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:01.900
Zakenna!

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:12.610
That's it! This is... This is what I wanted.

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:17.850
But was there a scene 
like this in the script?

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:19.980
The unexpected happens!

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:21.470
That's theater!

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:24.610
It's getting interesting.

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:25.830
It puts the real thing to shame!

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:27.570
It's powerful, isn't it?

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:28.590
Isn't it, Principal?

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:29.950
I was sleeping in the hotel.

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:33.780
Nagisa! Hurry, and transform mepo!

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.610
You, too, Honoka! Hurry!

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:36.310
It's impossible.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:39.120
There's no way we can transform right here.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:40.600
Zakenna!

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:46.310
Why do we have to fight you 
guys in a place like this?

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.900
Get out of here!

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.760
She's quite an actress, isn't she?

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:56.010
I have to admit even if she is my daughter...

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:57.190
I'm impressed!

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:00.510
Over there, Romeo!

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:19.190
Are you okay, Pollun?

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:20.870
I'm okay popo.

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:23.620
It's no use... Let's transform, Honoka.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:24.580
But...

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:27.620
The people will think it's part of the play.

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:29.650
It's time we showed them what we can do.

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:31.120
I don't care what you do...

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:32.610
Hurry, and transform mipo!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.760
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:51.620
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.330
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:58.140
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:01.530
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:04.960
Go back to where you came from!

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:08.800
Isn't it about time you acknowledged 
the great power of darkness?

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:11.690
If you do, there's no need 
to fight a fruitless battle.

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:14.640
Hurry, and give Stone Keeper back to us!

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:16.700
We won't return the seven stones!

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.610
Why do you want to take 
everything for yourself?

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:23.370
The stones exist for the sake 
of the power of darkness.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:26.100
It is darkness that will control eternity.

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:28.060
Zakenna! Zakenna!

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:28.870
Zakenna!

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.810
You never learn!

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:42.550
I'm going to see why Belzay 
didn't destroy you two!

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:15.070
Black! Are you okay?

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:17.520
Black!

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:19.390
Are you really okay mipo?

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.010
We need to back off for now.

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:22.630
We mustn't run.

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:26.350
We mustn't run away! We mustn't give up!

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:28.050
Black...!

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:30.400
We have to fight back!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.190
We have something we have to protect.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:35.370
All right.

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:38.580
What can you do in your condition?

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:41.520
Black!

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:42.540
I'm okay.

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:49.100
Black!

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:53.560
Pretty Cure!

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:55.710
Now I'm really mad!

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:57.230
This is unforgivable!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:04.870
You mustn't lose popo!

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:15.570
Accept the power of light popo!

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:34.750
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:38.300
And fight your way toward the future!

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:42.170
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:05.690
We're not done yet!

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:07.200
We still have the finale!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:11.630
Where are you, Romeo?

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.070
I'm here.

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:15.460
You poor thing!

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:27.520
No matter what happens, I promised 
myself that I wouldn't give up!

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:33.840
I can't collapse until I have you in my arms.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:37.750
I feel the same way.

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:43.480
Juliet! We have something 
that we must protect...

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.640
Romeo!

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:48.790
Pull yourself together, Romeo!

00:19:49.010 --> 00:19:51.550
We can't give in.

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:55.090
Romeo! Take my hand...

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:58.720
Even if I have just a little bit of power,

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:02.280
if we both join forces, I'm sure we can...

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:05.830
I'm sure we'll see a bright future ahead.

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.150
Romeo!

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:08.360
Juliet!

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:18.590
Ms. Yoshimi... What in the world is going on?

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:19.840
I have no idea...

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:23.860
But it was definitely a wonderful 
performance, wasn't it?

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:26.950
Nagisa!

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:28.780
Nagisa!

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:31.030
I didn't understand it, but it was great!

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:32.760
What magnificent action!

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:34.030
It puts the real thing to shame!

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:36.750
It's a new "Romeo and Juliet."

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:37.840
Isn't it, Principal?

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.240
I was sleeping in the hotel.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:50.690
I'm glad we managed to get through it.

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:54.470
I wasn't sure what was going 
to happen at one point.

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:59.200
I wonder what would have happened 
if those guys hadn't shown up?

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:00.970
What?

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:03.840
Pollun... you were great mipo!

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:05.440
Popo! Popo...!

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:09.400
I'll have you know that I had 
all my lines memorized...

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:12.940
But it's just that you all looked 
like you had nothing to do, so I...

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:18.260
Good job!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:19.760
Fujimura-kun!

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:23.480
Good job!

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:26.180
You were really forceful 
out there, Misumi-san.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:28.540
We couldn't tell if she 
was just acting, could we?

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:31.410
Thank you.

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.880
Come and see the Boys' 
Division school festival.

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:35.110
I will.

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:36.730
You'll come, too, won't you, Misumi-san?

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:38.460
Nagisa?

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:39.720
I will.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:41.600
See you!

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:48.080
Nagisa's no good when it comes to the 
actual performance, after all mepo.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.830
What do you mean by that?

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:51.670
Listen here, you...

00:21:51.670 --> 00:21:53.650
Do you like the guy who was just here popo?

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:55.820
We saw your reaction mepo.

00:21:55.820 --> 00:21:57.620
He's right, isn't he mipo?

00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:04.830
That might have been the wrong thing to say.

00:22:05.160 --> 00:22:07.280
What...

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:09.800
...are you trying to say?

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:11.700
Help popo!

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:13.610
We hit a bullseye mepo!

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:19.690
Come back here!

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:25.180
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:29.120
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:29.880
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:32.460
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:38.040
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:42.070
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.610 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:52.180
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:55.250
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.760
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:06.260
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:20.380
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:23.110
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:26.350
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:28.520
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:32.120
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:35.330
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:38.130
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:40.370
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:43.030
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:49.610
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:55.840
Ryota's going on an errand to Dad's company.

00:23:55.840 --> 00:23:57.580
Can he ride the right train?

00:23:57.580 --> 00:23:59.280
Does he know where to get on and off?

00:23:59.280 --> 00:24:00.690
Is it on the right or the left?

00:24:00.690 --> 00:24:01.860
Where am I?

00:24:01.860 --> 00:24:04.490
I have no idea!

00:24:04.490 --> 00:24:07.080
Don't worry... He just has 
to turn at the next corner.

00:24:07.080 --> 00:24:09.100
And there...

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.060
Zakenna?

00:24:11.560 --> 00:24:14.130
"IT TAKES GUTS! RYOTA'S 
GREAT ERRAND STRATEGY"

00:24:14.400 --> 00:24:16.670
So you're worried about Ryota, 
after all, aren't you?

00:24:16.670 --> 00:24:17.970
No, I'm not...

00:24:17.970 --> 00:24:20.030
You're not a very good liar.
